{% doc %}
  FLEXORA PDP buy box — trust, accordions, mini reviews (below free gifts).
{% enddoc %}
<div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras">
  <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__trust">
    <p class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__guar">
      🔒 Secure Checkout &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>90-Day</b> Money-Back Guarantee
    </p>
    <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__pays" aria-label="Accepted payment methods">
      {% render 'ss-payment-icons' %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__acc" data-ks-mp-pdp-acc>
    <details class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__detail">
      <summary>
        How It Works
        <span class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__chev" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__body">
        Slide the sleeve or brace on so the support sits centered on your knee or joint. FLEXORA compression helps stabilize movement during gym, walking, and recovery — wear during activity or rest, depending on your fit guide.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__detail">
      <summary>
        Features &amp; Formula
        <span class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__chev" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__body">
        Medical-grade knit with targeted compression zones, breathable stretch, and FLEXORA sizing for S–XXL. Built for daily wear, training, and post-workout recovery without bulk.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__detail">
      <summary>
        What is in the box?
        <span class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__chev" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__body">
        <ul>
          <li>FLEXORA support sleeve or brace (pair where applicable)</li>
          <li>Size &amp; fit guide card</li>
          <li>Care instructions</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__detail">
      <summary>
        Serving &amp; Use
        <span class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__chev" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__body">
        Choose your size from the chart, wear during workouts or long days on your feet, and hand-wash cold when needed. Replace when elasticity feels loose for best support.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__detail">
      <summary>
        Shipping &amp; Returns
        <span class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__chev" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__body">
        Pan-India dispatch on business days. Delivery typically in 2–5 days by pin code. Not the right fit? Use our 90-day guarantee — contact us with your order number for exchange or refund help.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__detail">
      <summary>
        Common Questions
        <span class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__chev" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="ks-mp-pdp-extras__body">
        <p><b>Which size should I pick?</b> Measure around the joint and match our size chart; between sizes, size up for comfort.</p>
        <p><b>Can I wear it all day?</b> Yes — many customers wear FLEXORA for gym sessions and daily support.</p>
        <p><b>Is this a medical device?</b> Support gear for comfort and stability; ask your clinician for injury-specific advice.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>

